# Cline Rules — fitness (monorepo)

## FIRST ACTION
Read `CONTEXT.md` in this repo root before every task.

## Then load based on task:
- Starting a session → also read `memory-bank/activeContext.md`
- Working on features → also read `memory-bank/progress.md`
- Touching packages/ or config → also read `memory-bank/techStack.md`
- Architecture decisions → also read `memory-bank/systemPatterns.md`

## Critical rule
Health sync logic belongs in `packages/health-sync/` only — never in app screens.

## Git
`Genoly Projects <git@hyperionsolutions.org>`
Never add Co-Authored-By Claude/Anthropic to commits.
Use Compact Prompt mode.
